//
// In this optimized version, we:
//   * keep the same mathematical algorithm and update order,
//   * change only data layout (A, Q are column-major in 'i'),
//   * express the (k,j) loop nest via a Noarr traverser over R,
//   * keep all i-loops as Noarr traversals over 1-D column views.
